date-released: 2026-11-19
version: "1.0.0"
url: "https://github.com/Ikramralem96/Bond-Graph-GNN-Dataset"

abstract: >
  A graph-structured dataset of Bond Graph models covering five physical
  domains: Electrical, Mechanical, Electromechanical, Thermal, and Hydraulic.
  The dataset is intended to support research on Graph Neural Networks,
  component recognition, structural learning, causality analysis, and
  physical-system classification.
